# Sentence syntax: a whole list program with no brackets and no punctuation.
# Run: nme r shopping-list-sentence.nme
set items to an empty list
append apples to items
append bread to items
append milk to items
show how many items
sort items
show items joined by comma
show the first of items
show the last of items
remove bread from items
show how many items
if items contains milk
show the milk is still there
end
if items is empty
show nothing left to buy
else
show still shopping
end
